      "displayName": "Orison Relief: Small Supply Haul",
      "titleSource": "localized_clean",
      "titleConfidence": "high",
      "briefing": "Hey, it’s El.\n\nNeed a reliable contractor for a pretty important delivery today. I’m sure you’re aware of what went down in Orison, big commotion. Made my job about ten times harder.\n\nAnyway, we’ve been contracted by Crusader to deliver some medical stuff to [Destination]. Pick up’s at [Location]. Shouldn’t be too heavy an order for this one, just make sure you’ve got a ship that can hold [MissionMaxSCUSize] cargo containers and a handheld tractor beam, or you’ll really embarrass yourself when you get there.\n\nLook, I’ll level with you. This job isn’t just hauling for hauling’s sake. Orison got pretty messed up by those Nine Tails, so anything we can do to help them out is probably the right thing to do.\n\nLet’s get it done,\n\nElla Tieno \nJr. Logistics Coordinator \nCovalex Shipping   \n'Anything you need, anywhere you need it.'",
